        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "39-6-1 The District will provide those teachers affected and the Association with a Full-time Continuous Service List. Any objection to the placement on the list shall be reported to the Association and the Assistant Superintendent of Human Resources or his/her designee within ten (10) school days after receipt of said list. After consideration of factors identified in Section 39-5, selection of teacher(s) to be reduced shall be made as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
