            "block_content": "B. In the event ties still exist, teacher(s) so affected shall participate in a drawing by lot to determine position on the Full-time Continuous Service List. The Association and all teachers so affected shall be notified in writing of the date, time and place of the drawing and shall have an opportunity to attend.",
