            "block_content": "39-6-1-2 Upon written request of the teacher(s) identified for reduction, the District shall investigate assignments in other programs for which the teacher(s) is licensed and qualified to teach. Under this article, a teacher shall be deemed to be licensed and qualified to render a teaching service if he/she meets any one (1) of the following:",
